    "text": "Stronger the ligand greater is splitting of d orbitals and smaller will be wave length of light absorbed.<br />The splitting power of ligands is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msup><mi>NCS</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math> So order of wave length of light absorbed is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mrow><mi>NC</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></msub></math>"
